@@ -794,24 +794,61 @@ compiled file says the name is read-only. See `docs/BYTECODE.md`.
 
 ```redblue
 try
-    set data to might fail files.read("config.rb")
+    set data to files.read("config.rb")
     process data
 catch error
-    say "Error: {error message}"
+    say "Error: {error}"
